@page "/pricing"

<PageTitle>Pricing | One Big Team</PageTitle>
<HeadContent>
    <meta name="description" content="Estimate One Big Team monthly pricing based on your active employee count. Final pricing is confirmed after organisation import.">
</HeadContent>

<SiteHeader CurrentPage="pricing" />

<main>
  <section class="pricing-hero section-band">
    <div class="section-inner pricing-hero-grid">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">Pricing</p>
        <h1>Clear HR pricing for growing teams.</h1>
        <p class="hero-text">
          One Big Team pricing is based on the number of active employees in
          your organisation. Use the estimator to get a guide monthly price
          before your team is imported.
        </p>
        <div class="hero-actions" id="trial">
          <a class="button button-primary button-large" href="/contact#contact-form">Start free trial</a>
          <a class="button button-secondary button-large" href="/contact#contact-form">Contact us</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside class="price-summary" aria-label="Pricing summary">
        <p class="summary-label">Estimated monthly price</p>
        <strong><span data-estimated-price>&pound;0</span></strong>
        <p>
          Based on <span data-estimated-employees>25</span> active employees at
          <span data-price-per-employee></span> per active employee per month.
        </p>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="section-inner estimator-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Estimator</p>
        <h2>Estimate your monthly One Big Team price.</h2>
        <p class="estimator-intro">
          Enter the number of active employees you expect to manage in One Big Team.
          The estimate updates instantly and is for guidance only.
        </p>
        <p class="pricing-note">Your final monthly price is confirmed after your organisation import, based on your active employee count.</p>
      </div>

      <form class="estimator-card" data-pricing-estimator>
        <label for="employee-count">Active employees</label>
        <div class="employee-input-row">
          <input
            id="employee-count"
            name="employee-count"
            type="number"
            min="1"
            step="1"
            inputmode="numeric"
            value="25"
            aria-describedby="employee-count-help"
          >
          <span>employees</span>
        </div>
        <p id="employee-count-help">
          Count employees who are active in your organisation and managed in the platform.
        </p>

        <div class="estimate-result" aria-live="polite">
          <span>Estimated monthly price</span>
          <strong data-estimated-price>&pound;0</strong>
        </div>

        <div class="rate-row">
          <span>Rate</span>
          <strong><span data-price-per-employee></span> per active employee/month</strong>
        </div>

        <p class="small-note">
          Billing and payment details are handled inside the One Big Team SaaS app,
          not on this public marketing website.
        </p>
      </form>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-muted">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <p class="eyebrow">What is included</p>
        <h2>One platform for core people operations.</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="benefit-grid">
        <div>
          <strong>HR records and documents</strong>
          <p>Manage employee information, company documents and shared HR resources.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <strong>Absence and workflows</strong>
          <p>Track leave, sickness, reminders and repeat HR processes in one place.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <strong>Recruitment and reporting</strong>
          <p>Support hiring activity and understand workforce trends as your team grows.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="payroll-callout">
        <strong>Payroll is not included.</strong>
        <p>
          One Big Team helps with HR and workforce management. Payroll processing,
          payslip generation and salary payments are not included in the product.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section faq-section">
    <div class="section-inner faq-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">FAQ</p>
        <h2>Pricing questions, answered simply.</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-list">
        <details>
          <summary>When do I add payment details?</summary>
          <p>
            Payment details are added inside the SaaS app when you are ready to
            activate billing. The public pricing page only provides an estimate.
          </p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>What counts as an active employee?</summary>
          <p>
            An active employee is a current team member imported into your organisation
            and managed in One Big Team. Former, archived or inactive records do not
            normally count toward the active employee total.
          </p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>Can my price change if my employee count changes?</summary>
          <p>
            Yes. Because pricing is based on active employee count, your monthly price
            can change as employees are added, removed, archived or reactivated.
          </p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>Is payroll included?</summary>
          <p>
            No. One Big Team does not include payroll. It supports HR records, leave,
            sickness, recruitment, documents, workflows, reminders and reporting.
          </p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>Can I cancel?</summary>
          <p>
            Yes. You can cancel your One Big Team subscription according to the terms
            agreed when billing is activated inside the SaaS app.
          </p>
        </details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="contact" class="section final-cta">
    <div class="section-inner cta-panel">
      <p class="eyebrow">Ready to see your price in context?</p>
      <h2>Start with your team size, then confirm after organisation import.</h2>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="button button-primary button-large" href="/contact#contact-form">Start free trial</a>
        <a class="button button-secondary button-large" href="/contact#contact-form">Contact us</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

<SiteFooter />
